## Layer5 integration

Keep the upgrade controller's `step` listener after the GameViewport/world listener. Original Main.Run precedes UpgradeMenu.Run; Destroy restores the game after that frame's Main already skipped gameplay. An upgrade completion in `beforeStep` that restores World before its current `step` would resume gameplay one frame early. The new test covers an after-world completion followed by gameplay on the next fixed frame.

